  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original genus fossil-form target retained: broad cap shell with offset spiral summit and internal shelf. Add the directly observed strong radial ribs, not a featureless conical limpet. [\"UF146378 supplies exterior plan and interior shelf but no lateral height view; height is an explicit taxon-level inference using a separate conspecific comparison\", \"No exact soft-body, shell colour in life, hidden internal coil or damage reconstruction is supported\", \"Broad fossil context is Pliocene, not a co-occurrence scene with other assets\"] {\"units\": \"metres\", \"diameter\": 0.048, \"height\": 0.022, \"diameter_tolerance_fraction\": 0.1, \"height_range\": [0.019, 0.027], \"diameter_basis\": \"UF146378 image: approximately304px shell diameter against318px white 5cm scale strip =>47.8mm; image estimate, not caliper measurement.\", \"height_basis\": \"Explicitly inferred illustrative height, constrained by cap shape and comparative PRI70705 lateral view; NOT a measured height of UF146378. PRI70705 stated25mm is not transferred as UF measurement.\", \"scope\": \"Genus-level specimen-informed study; do not advertise exact specimen dimensions or a morphometric replica.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Original genus fossil-form target retained: broad cap shell with offset spiral summit and internal shelf. Add the directly observed strong radial ribs, not a featureless conical limpet. [\"UF146378 supplies exterior plan and interior shelf but no lateral height view; height is an explicit taxon-level inference using a separate conspecific comparison\", \"No exact soft-body, shell colour in life, hidden internal coil or damage reconstruction is supported\", \"Broad fossil context is Pliocene, not a co-occurrence scene with other assets\"] {\"units\": \"metres\", \"diameter\": 0.048, \"height\": 0.022, \"diameter_tolerance_fraction\": 0.1, \"height_range\": [0.019, 0.027], \"diameter_basis\": \"UF146378 image: approximately304px shell diameter against318px white 5cm scale strip =>47.8mm; image estimate, not caliper measurement.\", \"height_basis\": \"Explicitly inferred illustrative height, constrained by cap shape and comparative PRI70705 lateral view; NOT a measured height of UF146378. PRI70705 stated25mm is not transferred as UF measurement.\", \"scope\": \"Genus-level specimen-informed study; do not advertise exact specimen dimensions or a morphometric replica.\"}"
